    {
        "content": "<p>Hey all, new contributor here!</p>\n<p>I added this PR (<a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/39868\">https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/39868</a>) that extends two existing proofs (<code>add_modByMonic</code> and <code>smul_modByMonic</code>) to include the <code>div</code> version, since the logic for <code>div</code> was already in the existing proof body.<br>\nSeeing that some results were present for <code>mod</code> but not for <code>div</code> I also added the \"dual\" of the existing <code>mod</code> results for what seemed like a reasonable amout of cases for a PR.</p>\n<p>Let me know if there was a reason for not having the <code>div</code> counterpart of these results and I missed it!<br>\nAlso, if there are any other such \"dual\" results that you think would make sense to add to this PR, happy to do that as well :)<br>\nLooking forward for any feeback!</p>",
        "id": 598532126,
        "sender_full_name": "Juan C",
        "timestamp": 1780052046
    },
    {
